/-!
# Fixed words for the finite max2 quotient incidence calculation

These four subgroup generators and 110 representatives are words in the
original certified quotient matrices. Their ambient memberships hold by their
types. No Sylow order, double-coset coverage, or candidate membership is claimed
by these definitions.

The untrusted GAP witness search and its data are preserved in source/.
It selected a Sylow subgroup of the intersection of the two candidates, then
computed double cosets. The two certificate obligations are deliberately
separate from these fixed definitions. See source/README.md for conventions,
source attribution, and the proposed power obstructions.
-/

@[expose] public section
open Subgroup
open Janko4.OuterReduction.FixedGenerator.NormalizerSquares.TwoCoreCentralizerData

namespace CFSG.Quasithin.Chapter1.XiEmbedding.InvariantThree.SporadicActions.J4Reduction.FiniteIncidence

/-- Evaluate literal signed words in the original quotient generators. -/
def evaluate (w : List (Bool × ℤ)) : LowerBound.quotientSubgroup :=
  (w.map (fun z => (if z.1 then
    (⟨LowerBound.quotientY, LowerBound.quotientY_mem⟩ : LowerBound.quotientSubgroup)
    else ⟨LowerBound.quotientX, LowerBound.quotientX_mem⟩) ^ z.2)).prod

